{"seq":2,"slug":"implementation-and-review-with-ai","title":"实现与评审阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/ai-across-the-lifecycle/implementation-and-review-with-ai","wordCount":2066,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"实现与评审阶段\">实现与评审阶段</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>实现是 agent 最先规模化渗透的环节，2025 年 5 月是个清晰的分水岭：5 月 16 日 OpenAI 把云端编码 agent Codex 带进 ChatGPT，可在后台并行处理多项任务（<a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/05/16/openai-launches-codex-an-ai-coding-agent-in-chatgpt/\">TechCrunch</a>）；三天后的 5 月 19 日，GitHub 将 Copilot coding agent 开放公测，官方描述是「像给同事派活一样把 issue 指派给 Copilot」（<a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2025-05-19-github-copilot-coding-agent-in-public-preview/\">Changelog</a>）。委派式开发从演示变成了日常选项。但当生成端产能陡增、评审端没有同步扩容时，瓶颈必然向审查一侧转移——写得快不算赢，审得住、审得过来才算。本节讨论 AI 如何改变实现、评审为何成为新的关键瓶颈、以及如何让这对环节高效且可靠地运转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>委派式开发</strong>：agent 在独立环境开分支、写实现、开 PR，开发从「坐在旁边」变成「派单与验收」，人的工作转向写清意图、引导方向、当场纠偏。</li>\n<li><strong>吞吐由短板决定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{merge}} \\le \\min(\\lambda_{\\mathrm{gen}}, \\lambda_{\\mathrm{review}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">gen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">review</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——生成端翻倍而评审端不动时，总吞吐纹丝不动，只是队列换了位置。</li>\n<li><strong>评审成为新瓶颈</strong>：Little&#39;s law <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 说明生成率抬高而评审容量不变时，等待评审的队列只能持续增长。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 产出有三类特有缺陷</strong>：克隆代码膨胀、抽象退化、「看起来对其实不对」——需要区别于人工代码的审查清单。</li>\n<li><strong>可审性在设计时决定</strong>：小步化要在实现阶段就设计进去，不能留到评审阶段补救。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：委派式开发把键盘上的节省变成了评审席上的账单，兑现速度的前提是把改动拆小并把硬件问题挡在会话内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ai-如何改变实现\">AI 如何改变实现</h2><p>当前 agent 开发有三种典型形态。<strong>异步委派</strong>：把 issue 指派给 Copilot coding agent 或 Codex，它在独立环境里开分支、写实现、提交并打开 PR，人只在 PR 上介入——开发从「坐在旁边」变成「派单与验收」。<strong>交互结对</strong>：Claude Code 式终端 agent 在本地仓库按 explore-plan-code-commit 循环工作，人随时纠偏，适合意图还在成形的任务。<strong>并行子代理</strong>：Claude Code 的 subagents 机制让每个子代理拥有独立上下文窗口，只把结论摘要带回主对话（<a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/sub-agents\">Claude Code Docs</a>）——并行收益与「没人看过全貌」的风险并存，转述失真是它的固有代价。</p>\n<p>无论哪种形态，人的工作都从逐行编写转向三件事：把意图与约束写清楚（CLAUDE.md、规格、验收标准成了新的「编程介质」）、引导方向、当场纠偏。agent 的产出天然是跨文件、成片的——一次实现一个特性或一次大范围重构——这既放大了产出，也放大了每一次产出需要被审的量。</p>\n<p>用吞吐视角看这对环节，有一个基本约束：合入速率不可能超过生成速率与评审速率中的较小者，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{merge}} \\le \\min(\\lambda_{\\mathrm{gen}},\\ \\lambda_{\\mathrm{review}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">merge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">gen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">review</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>生成端翻倍而评审端原地不动时，系统总吞吐纹丝不动，只是队列换了位置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"评审成为新的关键瓶颈\">评审成为新的关键瓶颈</h2><p>排队论给出了瓶颈的数学形态。Little&#39;s law <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span> 说明：在制品数量等于到达速率乘以周转时间。当 agent 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{gen}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">gen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 抬高而评审容量不变时，等待评审的 PR 队列只能持续增长——团队的真实产能卡在评审席上，「生成的快」兑现不成「合入的多」。</p>\n<p>更麻烦的是直觉在这里系统性失灵。METR 的对照实验测得资深开发者用 AI 反而慢 19%，而事前请经济学与机器学习专家预测，两组人分别错估了 39% 与 38% 的提速（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.09089\">arXiv:2507.09089</a>）。规划评审容量时应以实测数据而非厂商叙事为准，否则排期会在乐观预期下连环失守。瓶颈转移的全景分析见<a href=\"../rethinking-the-sdlc-with-ai/where-ai-changes-the-lifecycle\">AI 在生命周期里改变了什么</a>。</p>\n<p>AI 产出还有它特有的审查重点。GitClear 年度报告分析了 2.11 亿行改动代码（样本含 Google、Microsoft、Meta 等公司仓库），发现重构性的 moved 行占比从 2021 年的 25% 跌至 2024 年不足 10%，复制粘贴行则从 8.3% 升至 12.3%，历史上首次超过 moved 行；报告标题直接点出「克隆代码四倍增长」（<a href=\"https://www.gitclear.com/ai_assistant_code_quality_2025_research\">GitClear Research</a>）。与之互证，Stack Overflow 2025 调查中 66% 的开发者把「几乎对但差一点」列为头号挫败，45% 抱怨调试 AI 生成的代码更花时间（<a href=\"https://survey.stackoverflow.co/2025/ai\">2025 Survey</a>）。克隆膨胀、抽象退化、「看起来对其实不对」，构成了区别于人工代码的三类高频缺陷。</p>\n<p>修复环节的自动化上限同样有限：微软研究者将九个模型接入调试工具去解 SWE-bench Lite 的 300 个调试任务，最好的 Claude 3.7 Sonnet 成功率仅 48.4%，o1 为 30.2%、o3-mini 为 22.1%（<a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2025/04/10/ai-models-still-struggle-to-debug-software-microsoft-study-shows/\">TechCrunch 报道</a>）。也就是说，评审发现的 bug 大概率仍要人来兜底，评审兜底能力不可外包。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评审层</th>\n<th>抓什么问题</th>\n<th>主要手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机械层</td>\n<td>格式、类型、lint、回归</td>\n<td>编辑器 hooks 与 CI 必过门禁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义层</td>\n<td>逻辑错误、边界、并发、安全</td>\n<td>测试套件加 AI 初审（如 Copilot code review）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>意图层</td>\n<td>偏离规格、过度设计</td>\n<td>人对照规格终审</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 特有层</td>\n<td>克隆代码、幻觉 API、退化重构</td>\n<td>搜索重复块、验证 API 存在性、diff 结构比对</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"让实现与评审高效运转\">让实现与评审高效运转</h2><p>第一原则是小步化：Spec Kit 的 tasks 或 Kiro 的 tasks.md 把规格拆成离散小任务，天然产出小 diff；一次审一件事，大而混杂的改动只会让评审无从下手并提高放行风险的概率。可审性要在实现阶段就设计进去，而不是评审阶段补救。</p>\n<p>第二是把机械问题挡在会话内：lint、类型检查、单测应在 agent 会话内闭环修完才允许开 PR，别让机器能抓的问题消耗人的注意力。GitHub 文档中的 Copilot code review 可以承担第一遍初审，人保留最终判断（<a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/using-github-copilot/code-review/using-copilot-code-review\">GitHub Docs</a>）——AI 缓解的是评审量，不是评审责任。</p>\n<p>第三是控制在途工作量：并行 agent 数量就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\mathrm{gen}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">gen</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的旋钮，评审容量没有扩之前不要拧大它。反面模式很具体——无限并行导致 PR 洪峰，评审被迫橡皮图章，缺陷带着「已 review」标签入库。生成变便宜了，但质量成本只是转移到了下游，并没有消失。并行度的收益模型与硬上界见<a href=\"../team-workflows-and-collaboration/orchestrating-multiple-agents\">编排多个 Agent</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;agent 实现&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;会话内门禁: lint/type/test&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;开 PR&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;AI 初审&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;人终审&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;通过&quot;| F[&quot;合并&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;退回&quot;| A&#10;    C -.-&gt;|&quot;CI 失败&quot;| A\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"agent 实现\"] --&gt; B[\"会话内门禁: lint/type/test\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"开 PR\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"AI 初审\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"人终审\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"通过\"| F[\"合并\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"退回\"| A\n    C -.-&gt;|\"CI 失败\"| A</pre><h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>以下是可直接落地的操作配置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单一目的分支</strong>：一个 agent 会话只解决一件事；混合多个意图的 PR 直接要求拆分重开，而不是硬着头皮审。</li>\n<li><strong>PR 描述模板加两栏</strong>：「AI 参与范围」（哪些部分由 agent 产出）与「已通过的检查清单」，让评审者在开始阅读前校准注意力分配。</li>\n<li><strong>给 AI 初审划定权限边界</strong>：它可靠抓到的是遗漏的空值检查、风格漂移、测试缺口；架构取舍与安全边界类决定不进入它的建议范围，避免「两个 AI 互相背书」。</li>\n<li><strong>关键路径强制人审</strong>：用 CODEOWNERS 或仓库 rulesets 把核心模块设为必审区，agent 打开的 PR 一视同仁。</li>\n<li><strong>盯住三个指标</strong>：PR 中位大小、评审等待时间中位数、变更失败率——连成趋势线观察，任何一条恶化都说明生成与评审的产能失衡正在加剧。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>委派式开发把键盘上的节省变成了评审席上的账单。系统吞吐由生成与评审中较短的那块板决定：把改动拆小、把机械问题挡在会话内、把 AI 特有的缺陷模式写进 checklist、把并行度当作需要审批的产能请求——这些是让「写得快」兑现为「合得住」的全部前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实现与评审阶段","id":"实现与评审阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AI 如何改变实现","id":"ai-如何改变实现"},{"level":2,"text":"评审成为新的关键瓶颈","id":"评审成为新的关键瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"让实现与评审高效运转","id":"让实现与评审高效运转"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"规划与设计阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/ai-across-the-lifecycle/planning-and-design-with-ai"},"next":{"title":"测试与交付阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-augmented-sdlc/ai-across-the-lifecycle/testing-and-delivery-with-ai"}}